Changes;

---Meet your new best friend, the damage multiplier. You upgrade it using yth stone like any other stat, so more player choice. At this moment each upgrade adds 10% more damage, might increase to 15% later. (this will NOT ever increase your bullet damage.)

---Meet the Butcher, this new NPC will help you upgrade your multiplier. He is a lovely chap who will help you make your troubles go away faster.

---Sparing bosses now make their NPC variants appear in the final area, instead of enemies. For now they will only have a little dialogue each, this will be expanded later.

Bugfixes;

---Sparing bosses sometimes caused the ending to trigger, now fixed.


EDIT

HOTFIX;

---Enemies death trigger moved to avoid dead enemies starting new attacks if hit.

